{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":18,"code":"JOB","name":"Job","testament":"OT"},"chapter":29,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"JOB 29:1"},"Moreover Job continued his parable, and said, ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"JOB 29:2"},"Oh that I were as ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in"]}," months past, as ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in"]}," the days ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["when"]}," God preserved me; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"JOB 29:3"},"When his candle shined upon my head, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and when"]}," by his light I walked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["through"]}," darkness; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"JOB 29:4"},"As I was in the days of my youth, when the secret of God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was "]},"upon my tabernacle; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"JOB 29:5"},"When the Almighty ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was"]}," yet with me, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["when"]}," my children ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["were"]}," about me; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"JOB 29:6"},"When I washed my steps with butter, and the rock poured me out rivers of oil; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"JOB 29:7"},"When I went out to the gate through the city, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["when"]}," I prepared my seat in the street! ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"JOB 29:8"},"The young men saw me, and hid themselves: and the aged arose, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and "]},"stood up. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"JOB 29:9"},"The princes refrained talking, and laid ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["their"]}," hand on their mouth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"JOB 29:10"},"The nobles held their peace, and their tongue cleaved to the roof of their mouth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"JOB 29:11"},"When the ear heard ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["me,"]}," then it blessed me; and when the eye saw ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["me,"]}," it gave witness to me: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"JOB 29:12"},"Because I delivered the poor that cried, and the fatherless, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him that had"]}," none to help him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"JOB 29:13"},"The blessing of him that was ready to perish came upon me: and I caused the widow’s heart to sing for joy. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"JOB 29:14"},"I put on righteousness, and it clothed me: my judgment ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was "]},"as a robe and a diadem. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"JOB 29:15"},"I was eyes to the blind, and feet ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was"]}," I to the lame. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"JOB 29:16"},"I ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was"]}," a father to the poor: and the cause ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which "]},"I knew not I searched out. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"JOB 29:17"},"And I brake the jaws of the wicked, and plucked the spoil out of his teeth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"JOB 29:18"},"Then I said, I shall die in my nest, and I shall multiply ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["my "]},"days as the sand. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"JOB 29:19"},"My root ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was"]}," spread out by the waters, and the dew lay all night upon my branch. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"JOB 29:20"},"My glory ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was"]}," fresh in me, and my bow was renewed in my hand. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"JOB 29:21"},"Unto me ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," gave ear, and waited, and kept silence at my counsel. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"JOB 29:22"},"After my words they spake not again; and my speech dropped upon them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"JOB 29:23"},"And they waited for me as for the rain; and they opened their mouth wide ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," for the latter rain. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"JOB 29:24"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["If"]}," I laughed on them, they believed ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it"]}," not; and the light of my countenance they cast not down. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"JOB 29:25"},"I chose out their way, and sat chief, and dwelt as a king in the army, as one ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," comforteth the mourners. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 29:25"}]}]}
